  "notes": "Your Bizarre Adventure, or YBA, is a Roblox RPG based on JoJo's Bizarre Adventure. You pick up items that spawn around the map, use an Arrow to unlock a Stand (a spirit fighter that battles next to you), then level up by doing quests, beating gangs and fighting other players. Once you reach the level cap you can Prestige, which resets your level but opens more of the game. Update 1.8 added Crazy Diamond Requiem and Diver Down.\n\nCodes almost always give Lucky Arrows, and sometimes a Requiem Arrow or a 2x XP boost. Lucky Arrows are the reward to care about, since they are hard to find and give you another Stand roll with a better shot at a rare shiny version. New codes tend to show up with updates and like milestones, and uzuKee shares them on X and in the Discord.",
