  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why won't YBA let me redeem a code?",
      "a": "Codes need at least Prestige 1, and some older ones need Prestige 3. If you are still on your first run, reach the level cap and Prestige first, then try again."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are YBA codes case-sensitive?",
      "a": "Yes. Type them in capital letters exactly as listed, and keep any spaces or symbols in codes that have them."
    },
    {
      "q": "What do I do with the Requiem Arrow from GREATDAYS?",
      "a": "A Requiem Arrow evolves certain Stands into their Requiem form, such as Gold Experience or Crazy Diamond. Hold onto it until you have a Stand that can use it."
    }
  ],
